      "source": "Flag to explicitly enable or disable the <a href=\"#setKeyspacePopulator(org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init.KeyspacePopulator)\">keyspace populator</a> and\n<a href=\"#setKeyspaceCleaner(org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init.KeyspacePopulator)\">keyspace cleaner</a>.",
      "translation": "用于显式启用或禁用 <a href=\"#setKeyspacePopulator(org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init.KeyspacePopulator)\">键空间填充器</a> 和 <a href=\"#setKeyspaceCleaner(org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init.KeyspacePopulator)\">键空间清理器</a> 的标志。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"KeyspacePopulator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init\"><code>KeyspacePopulator</code></a> to execute during the bean destruction phase, cleaning up the keyspace and\nleaving it in a known state for others.",
      "translation": "将<a href=\"KeyspacePopulator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init 中的接口\"><code>KeyspacePopulator</code></a>设置为在 Bean 销毁阶段执行，以清理 keyspace 并将其置于已知状态供其他组件使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
